{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>大量非遊戲玩家表示，點單時未獲提示，打開袋看到陌生真人面孔感到突兀，並稱「影響食慾」「太醜了」。同時，還有網友認為，個別被印在杯子上的職業選手存在「不良黑歷史」。</p>\n<p>對於上述情況，瑞幸方面暫無回應。新浪財經多次聯繫瑞幸人工客服，截至發稿前均未獲聯繫。其中，瑞幸App端顯示「非常抱歉，當前人工坐席繁忙，請稍後重試」；瑞幸人工客服熱線則長時間無人接通。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/668/w550h918/20261103/eef0-53f2473a892dce1a06e2cf04eeb9f3a1.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/483/w550h733/20261103/bc20-302020380c774646fbee6720ff51a7d8.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/668/w550h918/20261103/eef0-53f2473a892dce1a06e2cf04eeb9f3a1.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:33.975136+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:32:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:39:14.162814+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:39:04.757595+00:00","content_hash":"532756f883b9a3acbafc33d23550207c56f516c532b880ebde4949a62bbd8f50","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:33.975136+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}